What happens if Department is deleted?

SharePoint lookup relationships can enforce relationship behavior. Two important options are:

  1)Restrict Delete:
  
  If Finance is being referenced by Budget Requests:
      Don't allow Finance to be deleted.
      This protects the relationship.
  
  2)Cascade Delete:
  
  If Finance is deleted:
      Related target items can also be deleted.
      SharePoint supports these relationship-delete behaviors for applicable Lookup relationships.
